<title>BELGIUM: EU to vet Telia/Ericsson deal.</title>
<headline>EU to vet Telia/Ericsson deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had started a routine review of a deal in which Sweden's Telia and Ericsson acquire joint control of AU-System Group, a group active in telecommunications consultancy services and software development.</p>
<p>Under EU rules, the Commission has one month to complete the investigation and either clear the deal or start a second-stage detailed inquiry. Most deals are cleared after the first stage.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
